data: {"id": "5a440c13475c48fd-thinking-parallel_evidence-1293", "run_id": "5a440c13475c48fd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 身份与生命周期：**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload`，UID `c4405668-4a40-44eb-9eed-a40f1a4ace4a`，调度至节点 `node2`，创建时间 `2026-09-11T09:03:17Z`。\n- 当前阶段：**Pending**，容器 `app` 状态 **Waiting/ContainerCreating**，无重启 (`restarts=0`)。\n- PromQL 指标一致确认：`kube_pod_status_phase=Pending(1)`、`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=ContainerCreating(1)`。\n\n**根因事件（来自 kubectl describe）：**\n- **`Warning FailedMount 12s (x21 over 26m) kubelet: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789119012258, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

