data: {"id": "5a440c13475c48fd-final", "run_id": "5a440c13475c48fd", "seq": 1298, "ts_ms": 1789119031335, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v04/workload 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found (fact-4e1ffb15f3c9) | 确认直接错误源：请求的 Secret 不存在且挂载非可选 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`: timed out waiting for the condition for unmounted volumes=[input] (fact-cfd74fab3790) | 确保持续阻塞状态，非瞬时故障 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-90a6b8e9cf90) | 确认容器处于等待挂载完成的阻塞状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-130c4be47dbd) | 确认 Pod 因容器未就绪而处于 Pending 阶段 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition`: `Ready=False`, `ContainersNotReady: app` (fact-1c26b0b63d52) | 确认核心应用容器处于未就绪状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason[reason=\"ContainerCreating\"] = 1` (fact-7a3bdfbbcb48) | 独立确认容器处于 ContainerCreating 等待状态 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0` (fact-ffa057e79f86) | 排除因 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的重启，确认启动前即被阻塞 |\n\n**证据说明**：\n1. **事实印证**：Kubernetes 事件明确指出 `secret \"unavailable-input\"` 不存在，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败，这与 Metrics 中容器状态持续为 `ContainerCreating` 且重启次数为 0 相互印证。\n2. **因果链**：Event 中的 `FailedMount` 错误是 `ContainerCreating` 状态的直接原因，而 `Pending` 是 `ContainerCreating` 的宏观表现，逻辑链闭环且无矛盾。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 定义引用不存在且非可选的 Secret 'unavailable-input' → kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → 容器持续等待 VolumeMount 完成 (ContainerCreating) → Pod 状态停留在 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 配置错误。\nPod `aiops-case-v04/workload` 的 Spec 中引用了名为 `unavailable-input` 的 Secret 作为挂载卷，该 Secret 在集群中不存在且挂载操作设置为非可选（Optional: false）。这导致 kubelet 在初始化阶段无法完成卷挂载，触发 `FailedMount` 事件，进而使容器无限期处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，Pod 无法进入 `Running` 状态。\n\n**支持证据**：\n- **证据 #1 (K8s Event)**：`secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` 明确指出了缺失资源。\n- **证据 #3 (K8s State)**：`ContainerCreating` 状态确认容器启动流程卡在挂载阶段。\n- **证据 #6 (Metric)**：`waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` 从监控维度独立验证了当前状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v04/workload: 35.3s (Evidence 27.7s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v04/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.275, "metrics": {"run_id": "5a440c13475c48fd", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.28148555755615, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64281.48555755615, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 61162.328481674194, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6584.093809127808, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2759.110689163208}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17563.72380256653, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 35252.809286117554, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11441.928148269653, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

